{"overview":"شبی در سینما که به ترس تبدیل می‌شود؛ مایکل و همراهش توسط زامبی‌ها مورد حمله قرار می‌گیرند. این فیلم کوتاه که در اوج موفقیت «تریلر» منتشر شد، کلیپ موسیقی را بازتعریف کرد، موانع نژادی را شکست و اولین فیلمی شد که به فهرست ملی فیلم‌های ایالات متحده وارد شد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A night at the movies turns terrifying when Michael and his date are attacked by zombies. Released at the height of Thriller’s success, the short film redefined the music video, broke racial barriers, and became the first inducted into the U.S. National Film Registry.","tagline_en":"","runtime":14,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["جان لندیس"],"crew_en":["John Landis"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مایکل جکسون","role":"Michael Jackson","photo":"/7n395uswvEXjVLk7784q8yxugvx.jpg","en":"Michael Jackson"},{"name":"Ola Ray","role":"Michael's Girlfriend","photo":"/ii6baCrYqNXBMFmPuGaCiUYlwdM.jpg"},{"name":"Vincent Price","role":"Narrator (voice)","photo":"/7JIv7U5kwveryP7hrPYgHlKea4d.jpg"},{"name":"Cynthia Garris","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":"/uAys5RtdP3e2cAGFZ0sL7ACAbdf.jpg"},{"name":"Mick Garris","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":"/tLozPAv9qM0hSpgbUF0Gt9T3Kqc.jpg"},{"name":"Hanala Sagal","role":"Dancer (uncredited)","photo":""},{"name":"Forrest J. Ackerman","role":"Man in Movie Theater (uncredited)","photo":"/b0Sj5Yt71ruCJN4CKUHOppWvHVG.jpg"},{"name":"Reed Armstrong","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":""},{"name":"ریک بیکر","role":"Zombie Opening the Crypt (uncredited)","photo":"/8thqXBS5CQF0U2zsHAVM9GH7i4I.jpg","en":"Rick Baker"},{"name":"Miko C. Brando","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":""},{"name":"James Canino","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":""},{"name":"Greg Cannom","role":"Zombie (uncredited)","photo":""}],"trailer":"UbW7nOThWuE","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/92060"}